window.products.push({"id":671360,"name":"Office Chairs - Ergonomic Gaming Executive Desk Chairs with Flip-up Armrests and Lumbar Support, Adjustable Swivel Rolling Chair, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":83.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D+22uRyIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🥇ERGONOMIC GAMING OFFICE CHAIR: The central area of the chair back and the seat cushion is filled with high-density rebound foam to provide the ultimate comfort for your spine and tailbone, thus avoiding the aches and pains caused by prolonged sitting. The one-piece lumbar pillow offers comfortable support for your lower back. Ring thickening design provides comfortable support for the shoulders and hips while helping you maintain the proper sitting posture for a long time. 🥇PREMIUM MATERIALS & HIGHEST CRAFTSMANSHIP: No Tearing, No Collapse, No Flaking, No Breakage. The computer chair is made of upgraded PU leather, skin-friendly, breathable, easy to clean, wear-resistant, and waterproof. The game chair has a reliable height-adjustable gas lift and a 5-star metal base that can withstand up to 275 pounds. Its 360° rotating wheels run smoothly and won't damage floors or carpets, making it suitable for most gamers. 🥇PADDED FLIP-UP ARMS: Foldable armrests are covered with nearly 2\" thick padding to provide the ultimate forearm and elbow comfort. The flip-up armrests also make it easier to push the leather office chair fully under the desktop to maximize space. You will feel ultimate comfort in this ergonomic chair. 🥇MULTI-FUNCTION DESIGN: The 90°-120° ROCKING design meets your different sitting positions, and the ADJUSTABLE HEIGHT design is suitable for all ages, such as children, teenagers, and adults. 360° ROTATION design allows you to adjust your position anytime and anywhere. The home office desk chairs to make your work and play more comfortable. 🥇EASY TO SET UP & PERFECT GIFT: Our executive office chair comes with all the hardware and necessary tools and can be assembled in just 20 minutes. The stylish look of this pc gaming chair will add a touch of glamour to the interior of any room. It is the perfect gift for your family or friends.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61D+22uRyIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OLIXIS","source_asin":"B0BN1MF8LQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671360","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN1MF8LQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN1MF8LQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
