window.products.push({"id":671362,"name":"Coasters for Drinks with Holder Set of 6, Blue Ceramic Coasters with Cork Base, Marble Ocean Absorbent Coasters for Drinks, No Scratched and Soiled, X","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LKAoMAvFL._AC_SL1375_.jpg","description":"🎁User-friendly Design: The ceramic coasters adopt a cork base bottom design, which not only prevents your table from scratches and scuffs but also provides additional gripping to the land, tightly sticks to the desktop, and easily handles bumps and drops. Moreover, the ceramic surface can withstand high temperatures, preventing your table from getting burned. 🎁Amazing Absorbency: Our absorbent coasters are made of a high-quality ceramic stone surface, compared to silicone, leather, or wood coasters, they can more quickly and effectively absorb tea, coffee beer, and water spills within 5-10 seconds. Keep your desktop and furniture surface dry and clean. Say goodbye to stains! 🎁Suitable Size: The diameter of the coasters is 4\", and the coaster's thickness is 0.24\", which can hold cocktail glasses, beer glasses, goblets, coffee cups, and some small cutlery, almost all types of cups. No matter which cup it is paired with, it is very beautiful and harmonious. Perfect for home, kitchen, dining room, and hotel. 🎁Easy Storage & Clean: Each set is equipped with a well-designed iron holder for storing your coasters and saving space. Run under warm water and scrub lightly as soon as the staining material comes in contact with sandstone. NOTE: Avoid using cleaners containing bleach as they may damage and discolor the surface. 🎁Great Gift Idea: Great idea for gifts for friends' birthdays, Christmas, Thanksgiving Day, and other memorable days. As creative gifts, your friends will like them.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71LKAoMAvFL._AC_SL1375_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Assixhu","source_asin":"B0BBLZZCHB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671362","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BBLZZCHB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BBLZZCHB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":671363,"name":"Georgetown Pottery Small Round Ikebana Flower Vase, Purple Wave","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LdVyyEDWL._AC_.jpg","description":"Georgetown Pottery Ikebana Vases are designed to be simple, graceful and elegant. Our Ikebana vases are nationally known and sold in galleries, showrooms and gift shops across the country. Each vase is designed to accentuate all parts of the flower so anyone can create a wonderful arrangement with just a few blooms. The Small Round Ikebana Vases are a slightly smaller version of our incredibly popular Round Ikebana and perfect for any place that a delicate arrangement would be welcome. Each vase measures 4 3/4 inches in diameter and is handmade of fine porcelain at our studio in Georgetown Maine. They are individually glazed, decorated, fired in our kiln at 2500 degrees, and finally finished by permanently affixing a pin frog inside the vase. The prongs of the pin frog pierce the stems of your flowers and allow them to absorb water much longer than any traditional vase. This significantly prolongs the life of your blooms, in some instances to up to 3 weeks. Like all of our products, they are hand made in the USA by local artists.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41LdVyyEDWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Georgetown Pottery","source_asin":"B003VPED9A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671363","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003VPED9A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003VPED9A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
