window.products.push({"id":671430,"name":"RISICULIS Large Bread Box for Kitchen Countertop, Bread Storage Container, and Utensil Organizer with Bamboo Cutting Board Lid, Clear Bread Bin, Bread","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UE+Ee6rGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Keep Bread Fresh】：The breadbox can balance the air and moisture in the box well, balance the humidity, keep the bread fresh for a long time, and lock the flavor. Comes with 15 bread preservation bags, which greatly extend the preservation time of bread and preserve the deliciousness of food. 【Large Capacity Bread Keeper】: The homemade bread storage has a size of 14*11*8.6 inches, which can hold most of the food, with extra flat storage space on the top, providing you with more kitchen storage space and keeping the kitchen countertop neat and tidy, simple and luxurious, it adds glamour to your kitchen and cabinets. 【Multifunctional Clear Bread Box】: The bread boxes for kitchen with lid and the top can store various foods that need to be stored and kept fresh, such as bread, fruits, grains, seasoning jars, etc. The matching storage box suitable for storing kitchen utensils such as knives, bread tongs, cutlery and forks. Optimize the kitchen space, and make the kitchen counter look organized and beautiful. 【2 in 1 Cutting Board Lid】: The kitchen utensils organizer box that comes with the plastic bread container has a tightly closed bamboo lid, which can be used as a cutting board, you can cut bread on it, it is convenient and durable, easy to clean, you only need wash it after use and air-dry it, or wipe it with a soft cloth. 【Convenient and Practical】: The bagel container can be opened on the side or top according to your needs, and the side cover is magnetically attracted. Additionally, a lock can be installed on the side of the bread box on the oversized kitchen counter to prevent the contents from falling out or being opened by curious kids and pets. It requires assembly, but no small parts like screws, you just follow the instructions in the manual and you can easily assemble it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71UE+Ee6rGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RISICULIS","source_asin":"B0BCPRZ4TB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671430","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCPRZ4TB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCPRZ4TB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
