window.products.push({"id":671508,"name":"BUDO Fruit Basket, 3-Tier Fruit Bowl Vegetables Countertop Storage with Banana Hanger, Iron Metal Detachable Bread Holder Fruit Tray for Kitchen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GekhHY8kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SPACING SAVING】 BUDO 3 layers fruit basket helps to solve the problem of your messy countertop. The design of 18.3 inches tall can free up counter space to keep you table tidy. In addition, the fruit storage basket has a leaf hook, which can hang bananas or grapes at the same time. PLEASE NOTE: Fruits veggies and other props are for demonstration only, they are NOT included. 【ECO-FRIENDLY AND STURDY】 Made of high quality wrought-iron metal with BPA-free and food-safe powder coating, it is safe to store food. Moreover, the rust-proof and moisture-proof coating can be used as washing fruits and vegetables strainer. Designed with three raised globular feet which not only make basket steady, but also prevent your food from touching the table. 【VERSATILE USE】 3 in 1 fruit tray with detachable design can be used as a 1, 2 or 3 tier baskets, you can DIY them to storage fruits, vegetables, bread, snacks, toys, cosmetics, etc on the baskets. And this organizer can be placed in different locations such as kitchen, living room, bathroom or anywhere. 【SIMPLE ASSEMBLE】 No tool and screw-free assemble, No complicated wall mount fixtures, No drilling, it features a Leaf-shaped carrying handle and everything in the basket can be carried around. It is very simple and easy for you to assemble and disassemble, only taking you 1 minute on it. BUDO 3-tier fruit rack can be used as three separate baskets for individual serving tray. 【EXQUISITE DESIGN】 BUDO fruit holder has many leaf elements, which makes it look more vibrant. The stylish look matches most home décor schemes. The top leaf-shaped handle can be used as banana holder or grapes hanger, and as a hand grip to move this fruit hammock conveniently for picnics. Wonderful for parties and family gatherings.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GekhHY8kL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BUDO","source_asin":"B0B3M36GRH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3M36GRH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3M36GRH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
