window.products.push({"id":671510,"name":"DODAHA Home Coffee Roasters Machine with Timer, 110V Coffee Bean Roaster for Home Use, Large Non-Stick Coffee Roasting Machine for Nut Peanut Chestnut","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":149.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yeCzwqvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"☕ LARGE CAPACITY: Upgraed home coffee roasters provides larger roasting chambers for bigger batches(750g/1.65lb/26.45 ounces). Also can roast few small batches to create your own blends perfectly, you can have your freshest coffee always. ☕ EASY OPERATION FOR BEGINNER: Automatic coffee roaster machine for home use with adjustable temperature(100-240℃/212-464℉) and timer(0-60 minutes), greater controllability, flip a switch and walk away, the coffee roasting machine will automatically complete the roasting, you can access the full range of roasts, from blond to Italian. ☕ PROFFESSIONAL DESIGN: Non-stick interior coating makes clean-up a breeze. Thermostatical system and strong rotating arm keeps the beans tumbling for an even roasting constantly, no matter how dark you want to go. Compact size for easily move around and store. Heatproof coffee bean roaster machine with glass cover lets you watch your roast in action and smell amazing fragrance from the venting holes. Upright standable handle for easy placement. ☕ VERSATILE: Food-grade home coffee bean roaster with modern shape, not only aesthetic, but safe and healthy. This coffee bean roasting machine can be used to roast many kinds of beans, including coffee beans, nut, soybeans, chestnut, barley, dried fruit, peanuts and so on. And as a bonus, it can pop popcorn too! ☕100% WARRANTY: This home coffee roaster could be used for home, coffee shop or restaurant ect. We offer 100% refund or free replacement for this nut roaster if you are not satisfied with our product. Please contact us if any question you do have, thank you! Just a reminder, please stop the roast a little before your desired roast level. Cool the beans off as quickly as possible.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71yeCzwqvNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DODAHA","source_asin":"B09LYK8DWW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LYK8DWW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LYK8DWW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
