window.products.push({"id":671729,"name":"ROMUCHE Christmas Tree Topper Gold Star Tree Topper with Rotating Santa Led Projector Christmas Tree Topper Lighted for Tree Toppers Christmas Decorat","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iS77fEM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[2022 New Upgrade Christmas Tree Topper]: Our Christmas tree star topper designed with 3D star or snowflake shape, silver coating with shinning glitter powders and the hollow design make this Christmas tree topper great decoration for your Christmas tree. Christmas tree topper lighted can project different star patterns, such ac Star, Snowflake, Santa, Christmas tree, Elk, Jingling Bell and so on. All pattern spin and move on the ceiling, which create a strong Christmas festive atmosphere. [Perfect Size of Star Tree Topper Fits Most Christmas Tree]: Our Christmas tree topper measures 8.85\" x 8.66\" x 2.75\". Its base is shaped like a hat (2.16\" in dia.), which is suitable for most Christmas trees. This unique design provides greater flexibility for installation and offers a better stability and it is lightweight and durable. It is the most indispensable ornament of this Christmas. Let’s dress up this tree topper on your Christmas tree to add festive atmosphere to your Christmas. [Adjustable Gorgeous Projection Effect]: The size of the projection from the Christmas tree topper can be changed by adjusting the distance between tree topper and the wall or ceiling. The farther from the ceiling, the larger the projection range. Distance to ceiling 3ft, projection range is 2*3ft, Distance to ceiling 4ft, projection range is 3*4ft. The classic and innovative design with bright glowing-out light would definitely bring you great warm and Christmas holiday touch in this new year. [Easy to Decorate Christmas Tree Topper Star on Christmas Tree]: A specially designed design of tree topper is fixed to the Christmas tree, which is strong and sturdy. Just attach the Christmas tree topper to the top of a Christmas tree, plug it in, and you get the illusion of star lighting and sparkling Christmas trees. The UL listed plug is safe for running normally in a -31F°- 100F° extreme climate. Please note that: The AC plug should be protected during outdoor operation in bad weather. [The Best Christmas Gift Idea]: ROMUCHE Christmas tree topper comes with a beautiful gift box packaged, which looks more distinctive and has Christmas element. Christmas tree topper lighted is a ideal gift for your family and friend. Our Christmas tree decoration not only decorate Christmas tree, but also can be used as a LED projector light. This Christmas tree topper star is perfect for Christmas party, New Year, home, yard, cafe, pub, bar, restaurant, office, shopping mall, hotel.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81iS77fEM8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ROMUCHE","source_asin":"B0BFJGFYFK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671729","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFJGFYFK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFJGFYFK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
