window.products.push({"id":671900,"name":"Mark Lewis Art Liz Taylor ceramic mug 11 oz cup - cop","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nyE2q1xrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"LIZ TAYLOR COFFEE MUG Elizabeth Taylor coffee mug by artist Mark Lewis. These 11 oz ceramic cups are HAND signed and numbered. That is very unique indeed. This cup was created from an original painting titled \"The Color Of Passion 2\" painted by Mark Lewis. After signing each coffee cup it's signature and number are hot baked on the cup to make it permanent. These 11 oz best quality cups are microwaveable. We recommend hand washing to preserve the signature. MARK LEWIS ART Mr. Lewis is a living ancestor of Denton Cy Young the legendary baseball player and Baseball Hall Of Fame recipient for which the Cy Young Award was named. This award is given every year to the best pitcher in the American and National Baseball leagues. Mark's career path has certainly been an eventful one as well. After serving honorably in the United States Navy Lewis then delved into the performing arts. He spent years as a successful actor, appearing in numerous movies and television programs. He owned and operated Vocational Training Centers in Southern California to help people gain useful skills to become employable. Ultimately he turned his focus to painting celebrity portraits. Lewis brought his expansive life adventures, raw talent and inspiration to the canvas. Lewis instills an immense beauty and creativity in the work that flows from his palette. He achieves that rare feat among artists of creating an unspoken dialog between artist and viewer in his paintings. Lewis' signature artwork including paintings, prints and mugs have been and are being exhibited in numerous art galleries throughout the United States. Start your collection today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81nyE2q1xrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mark Lewis Art","source_asin":"B00YDN077G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671900","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00YDN077G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00YDN077G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
