window.products.push({"id":671991,"name":"Haus and Hues Line Art Mid Century Modern Wall Decor - Boho Prints Wall Art Abstract Geometric Wall Decor Line Art Wall Decor Prints for Wall Decor Bo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m-rMYqoxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIFY DECOR STYLES: This unconventional abstract geometric art brings your room together by blending the best of certain design styles, such as boho, minimalist, mid-century, modern and Scandinavian art wall decor. Its neutral design combined with its earthy background create a unifying pattern and a neutral palette that can help create a focal point or harmonize a gallery wall. ACCENT THE BOHO LOOK: With its fluid lines and minimal design, this geometric wall art is the perfect piece to draw interest and add a cohesive look to your gallery wall. Surround this minimalist wall art with other unique boho prints to curate an interesting photo wall. Whether you’re going for a midcentury modern decor theme or simply want to incorporate a touch of boho in your space, Haus and Hues has a wide selection of boho posters and minimalist wall art that will fit your style. PREMIUM QUALITY: To achieve the quality we’re known for, we use a giclée printing technique on 270 GSM solar white linen paper. The paper we use for boho wall art is sourced in the US, and our inks are water-based and toxic-free. Our Pennsylvania oak frame adds the finishing touch to the neutral wall art. It’s equipped with plexiglass covered by protective film and two metal hangers for horizontal or vertical hanging. Boho painting is shipped in a durable box for protection while in transit. SATISFACTION GUARANTEE: Our in-house team ensures every geometric shape posters order passes our quality inspection to minimize misprints and order defects. We want you to shop our abstract wall art with confidence, so we offer a hassle-free return and refund guarantee. If you're not satisfied with your purchase, let us know and we'll provide you with a full refund or replacement. A THOUGHTFUL GIFT: Our boho art prints will make a great gift for friends and family. Give your loved ones this Scandinavian wall decor for a birthday, housewarming, graduation, Christmas, or any special occasion. This terracotta wall decor is a perfect way to add color and a personal touch to any space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81m-rMYqoxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HAUS AND HUES","source_asin":"B08RBB9FXP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-671991","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RBB9FXP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RBB9FXP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
